|---|---|---|
| `users` | Stores authenticated users if user accounts are included | MVP scope depends on release model |
| `properties` | Stores property-level facts, external identifiers, location, physical attributes, and normalized profile data | Must distinguish user-provided facts from external-source facts |
| `analysis_runs` | Stores each recommendation session and input snapshot | Required for reproducibility |
| `recommendation_catalog` | Canonical list of repair/improvement types and subtypes | Must support parent-child repair categories |
| `duration_lead_time_rules` | Duration and lead-time assumptions by repair type/subtype | Required MVP seed table with review metadata |
| `dependency_rules` | Predecessor and sequencing constraints between repair types | Required MVP seed table; row-level export and expert validation open |
| `recommendation_anomaly_rules` | Warning rules separate from normal ranking | Must include staging under-21-days rule |
| `recommendation_results` | Ranked recommendation outputs | Must store category, score, cost, value, timing status, and confidence |
| `recommendation_trace` | Internal explanation and audit trail | Must persist rule IDs, seed versions, source IDs, anomaly IDs, and model IDs where used |
| `source_registry` | Source inventory for APIs, static datasets, workpapers, fixtures, model artifacts, and seed tables | Must include source scope, confidence, access date, and review status |
| `coefficient_sets` | Versioned ROI/hedonic/calibration coefficients | Must distinguish placeholder, owner-approved, diagnostic, candidate, approved, retired, and rejected values |
| `market_model_versions` | Future database representation of versioned model artifacts | Should store model identity, market, target, model type, status, approval flag, training window, artifact path, and approval decision reference |
